{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mandate Order is a strategy game set in the Warring States period. Starting from barren lands, build strongholds integrating production, defense and military functions. Manage resources and the people's will, expand your territory, counter threats, and ultimately rise to prominence amidst the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mandate Order Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">===========================================================================================</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. &quot;Build&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fortify your economy by erecting defenses, developing farming and industry to withstand disasters and conflicts. Enjoy robust farming, construction, gathering and production systems to live out your ancient settlement dream.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/20d2c0787b350e5f41cf0d5811f8901a.poster.avif?t=1770103662\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/20d2c0787b350e5f41cf0d5811f8901a.webm?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/20d2c0787b350e5f41cf0d5811f8901a.mp4?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. &quot;Stratagem&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch defensive/offensive wars and deploy special units: Chariot Troops, Panda Warriors,Elite Infantry. Master war architecture via walls/fortifications with a physics system, embracing the ancient pragmatism of &quot;maximizing resources&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/b2b0110c5f479d1ed7f4649a70ec79ef.poster.avif?t=1770103662\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/b2b0110c5f479d1ed7f4649a70ec79ef.webm?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/b2b0110c5f479d1ed7f4649a70ec79ef.mp4?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. &quot;Conquer&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch defensive/offensive wars and deploy special units: Chariot Troops, Panda Warriors, Wei Elite Infantry. Master war architecture via walls/fortifications with a physics system, embracing the ancient pragmatism of &quot;maximizing resources&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/d464f8613c27e2921333be929b591521.poster.avif?t=1770103662\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/d464f8613c27e2921333be929b591521.webm?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/d464f8613c27e2921333be929b591521.mp4?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. &quot;Worship&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offer sacrifices to heaven and earth for national fortune\u2014the system impacts disasters and events. Your choices will test your morality. As the old saying goes: &quot;Fortune and misfortune are intertwined\u2014disaster may breed opportunity.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/5b473e8b2e30af4558592185ed36d15b.poster.avif?t=1770103662\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/5b473e8b2e30af4558592185ed36d15b.webm?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/5b473e8b2e30af4558592185ed36d15b.mp4?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. &quot;Reform&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advance technology, upgrade buildings and optimize logistics to experience tool progress and institutional/civilizational transformation. Adapt governance to sandbox terrain/resources, reform to strengthen your state and discard the obsolete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/1ee0b992c023c26ae2bf77e8ff9191f1.poster.avif?t=1770103662\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/1ee0b992c023c26ae2bf77e8ff9191f1.webm?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/1ee0b992c023c26ae2bf77e8ff9191f1.mp4?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Note</strong>\uff1a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This test version does not include all planned content. Follow our community to track the development progress continuously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">===========================================================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We acknowledge that the current version falls short of your expectations. We firmly believe a truly complete game isn\u2019t born in isolation\u2014it\u2019s refined through continuous dialogue with players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With humility and determination, we look forward to your critical feedback and suggestions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1733690?t=1770103662","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1733690?t=1770103662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/5ab4941b3167ea030d4179a83dff8c1417639023/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770103662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/5ab4941b3167ea030d4179a83dff8c1417639023/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770103662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mandate Order is a strategy game set in the Warring States period. Starting from barren lands, build strongholds integrating production, defense and military functions. Manage resources and the people's will, expand your territory, counter threats, and ultimately rise to prominence amidst the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mandate Order Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">===========================================================================================</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. &quot;Build&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fortify your economy by erecting defenses, developing farming and industry to withstand disasters and conflicts. Enjoy robust farming, construction, gathering and production systems to live out your ancient settlement dream.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/20d2c0787b350e5f41cf0d5811f8901a.poster.avif?t=1770103662\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/20d2c0787b350e5f41cf0d5811f8901a.webm?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/20d2c0787b350e5f41cf0d5811f8901a.mp4?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. &quot;Stratagem&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch defensive/offensive wars and deploy special units: Chariot Troops, Panda Warriors,Elite Infantry. Master war architecture via walls/fortifications with a physics system, embracing the ancient pragmatism of &quot;maximizing resources&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/b2b0110c5f479d1ed7f4649a70ec79ef.poster.avif?t=1770103662\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/b2b0110c5f479d1ed7f4649a70ec79ef.webm?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/b2b0110c5f479d1ed7f4649a70ec79ef.mp4?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. &quot;Conquer&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch defensive/offensive wars and deploy special units: Chariot Troops, Panda Warriors, Wei Elite Infantry. Master war architecture via walls/fortifications with a physics system, embracing the ancient pragmatism of &quot;maximizing resources&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/d464f8613c27e2921333be929b591521.poster.avif?t=1770103662\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/d464f8613c27e2921333be929b591521.webm?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/d464f8613c27e2921333be929b591521.mp4?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. &quot;Worship&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offer sacrifices to heaven and earth for national fortune\u2014the system impacts disasters and events. Your choices will test your morality. As the old saying goes: &quot;Fortune and misfortune are intertwined\u2014disaster may breed opportunity.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/5b473e8b2e30af4558592185ed36d15b.poster.avif?t=1770103662\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/5b473e8b2e30af4558592185ed36d15b.webm?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/5b473e8b2e30af4558592185ed36d15b.mp4?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. &quot;Reform&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advance technology, upgrade buildings and optimize logistics to experience tool progress and institutional/civilizational transformation. Adapt governance to sandbox terrain/resources, reform to strengthen your state and discard the obsolete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/1ee0b992c023c26ae2bf77e8ff9191f1.poster.avif?t=1770103662\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/1ee0b992c023c26ae2bf77e8ff9191f1.webm?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/extras/1ee0b992c023c26ae2bf77e8ff9191f1.mp4?t=1770103662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Note</strong>\uff1a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This test version does not include all planned content. Follow our community to track the development progress continuously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">===========================================================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We acknowledge that the current version falls short of your expectations. We firmly believe a truly complete game isn\u2019t born in isolation\u2014it\u2019s refined through continuous dialogue with players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With humility and determination, we look forward to your critical feedback and suggestions.</p>","developers":["Digital Sky"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733690/680bcf89d63afeab0e88449794b7d2e1b99b29ec/header.jpg?t=1770103662","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":